{"version":1,"key":"doc:project:21:206","content":{"id":206,"title":"22 T 细胞和 B 细胞的共舞","content":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"d9d0d200-0b6b-48f1-9589-8161a7cc1ef6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"受体和抗原不是完美结合的，只要 B 细胞的受体可以识别出抗原，就能活化，虽然生成的抗体不完美，但是能快速反应，随后使用精妙的系统微调，改进抗体，变成完美。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"24d67421-eb4b-4be3-9104-9360bf442eae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 细胞被辅助性 T 细胞激活变成浆细胞，每次 B 细胞首要 辅助性 T 细胞的阳性信号，就会进行一轮有目的的突变，体细胞超变（亲和力成熟），生成的抗体随之发生变化。"}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"11fdff2c-10ba-4f45-b147-47d032a9c77c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"过程："}]},{"type":"numbered-list","tauContract":"3a3b4d6f4d2098952ffe3c6e00baedd170e840beb6fb5fc715467ae5845e0156","collabId":"22bab391-7949-4ee4-bd66-093d89d30daf","children":[{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"e3fd9d47-0e69-406a-b9ec-c53841a5e128","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"e10aa451-4346-4441-a6a2-3c3a560a06c3","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"B 细胞生成抗体后会去战场，如果战争还在继续，就会有大量抗原通过淋巴液"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"7c33d2da-715b-4252-9a55-14116e117686","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"ddf606ec-58f8-4945-9608-66b15946a68b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果改进的抗体变差了，它和抗原结合就会困难，这个 B 细胞会随后自我了断"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"6cb2946d-1fc8-496e-85ad-2f874cae224e","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"748009bd-45d9-4c2f-9d1c-3884cc4fccac","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"如果提升了抗原识别能力，就会再次受到激活信号，B 细胞继续改进"}]}]},{"type":"list-item","tauContract":"fe3a1fc1f6dcf1c1c317754db368a19bd85cab343431da98cae17d783eaa1c02","collabId":"ab15ae06-898f-40ef-b9d1-2db4b4152b02","children":[{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"1a30aba7-b57c-4771-950f-5936ff0e74ae","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"经过一轮轮筛选，改良最好的 B 细胞能留下来，做后变成浆细胞"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"c8790325-0f65-4c10-abf8-a3491b2661a6","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":"这就是面对几十亿能变异的病原体，人体是如何有效应对的，快速适应，改良武器至完美。                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                  "}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"dfb8a80f-57ff-4cb8-839d-f7b52f3f9f1b","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"393c41c2-a985-401b-acbb-61b4d3e2f623","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,"tauContract":"f4b9b0426991dbd09af21b77c91da8b4112b2e3901b6af87feb71cb3b7772fb1","collabId":"454018b1-0793-4b77-8743-9b49c2cddb2c","children":[{"type":"formatted","text":""}]},{"type":"paragraph","disableDrag":false,